Subject: [PATCH] Evolver: show the lock screen at the top of its page

Open Expressive Studio's lock screen page with the lock screen as it is
now, the name of its clock face, and buttons for the clock face picker
and the wallpaper picker.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
